87	/// Driven directly against `EntriesRepository.search()` rather than
88	/// `EntriesSearchCubit` — `entries_search_cubit_test.dart` already proves
89	/// the debounce/generation-guard state machine against a fake repository;
90	/// this file's own job is only the real network + real disk pipeline
91	/// underneath it, matching `entries_list_flow_e2e_test.dart`'s/
92	/// `entry_detail_flow_e2e_test.dart`'s own split between cubit-level and
